//"Anil"
//"Yogesh"
//4
//3
//"Sarthak,Yogesh,Anil";`},{type:"paragraph",text:"In order to make the list work with Objects and Arrays data. We will need to update the find method to compare two different objects and arrays."},{type:"code",language:"javascript",value:`//Find item from the list
