copy.name;
//"Sarthak"

copy.age;
//24;`},{type:"paragraph",text:"Every object in Javascript is linked to a prototype object from which it can inherit properties and methods. Prototype object comes standard with Javascript and is available with every object that is created with object literals."},{type:"code",language:"javascript",value:`let obj = {};

