// "I am resolved"
// "Task done";`},{type:"paragraph",text:"To use it we have to mark the function with the async keyword and then we can use the await keyword inside the async function."},{type:"paragraph",text:"The code is wrapped inside a try-catch-finally block to for frictionless execution."},{type:"paragraph",text:"async keyword with different function declaration."},{type:"code",language:"javascript",value:`// fat arrow
